,"image","gameplay","The live coastal ride after acceleration, a first jump and a camera change.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/pelican-bike-claude.webp","alt","A white pelican riding a bicycle along a three-dimensional coast, with speed, distance, fish and achievement HUD.","https://claude-opus-5-5.riba2534.cn/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[87],"Claude Code","links","相关资源",[93,94],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":87,"_25":97},{"_62":95,"_25":96},"Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","/zh/resources/claude-code/","创作者开发记录",[101],"evidence",{"_62":102,"_25":103,"_104":105},"查看作者的 AI 使用说明","https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo#readme","note","Creator-published prompt and session summary, with exact Claude Code attribution. The model-led long-run tests described there were not repeated by GameMap.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[110],{"_62":111,"_25":112,"_104":113},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo/tree/main/pelican-bike","Complete pelican-bike source, build script and procedural assets. Run npm install and node build.mjs in that subdirectory, then open dist/index.html. The repository contains three distinct games; this case selects only the pelican game. Package metadata names ISC, but no repository-wide licence text is supplied.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[119],{"_62":120,"_25":75,"_104":121},"试玩鹈鹕骑单车","Keyboard and touch controls; W/S accelerate/brake, A/D change lanes, Space jumps and C changes camera. A muted entry is available. Desktop launch, acceleration, jump achievement and camera change were checked.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","prompt","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[129],{"_62":130,"_25":103,"_104":-7},"阅读原始提示词与开发记录","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[135,136,137,138],"Start a muted ride, accelerate with W/S, change lanes with A/D and jump with Space.","Compare the published one-sentence prompt with the pelican, bicycle, cloth, ocean and camera modules.","In pelican-bike, install dependencies and run node build.mjs; open the resulting dist/index.html in a browser.","Change one collection or cycling rule, then check movement, jump, score feedback and restart.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者说明使用 Claude Code 中的 Claude Opus 5.5，从一句中文提示开始生成游戏。README 公开提示词，并记录模型进行浏览器测试及后续修复的过程；“人工未改代码”是作者自述，并非独立测量的创作比例。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Three.js · JavaScript","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[135,136,137,138],{"_62":170,"_25":103,"_17":125},{"_62":169,"_25":75,"_17":115,"_104":121},{"_62":166,"_25":112,"_167":168,"_104":113},{"_62":165,"_25":103,"_104":105},[163,164],"claude-code","threejs","Read the creator’s AI attribution","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Play Pelican on a Bike","Read the original prompt and development account",{"_172":173},"documents",{"_67":174,"_35":175},[177,181,182,183,180,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,179,216,178,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234],[176,177,178,179,180],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-n